    "title": "Chocolate Poodle",
    "text": "• The Chocolate Poodle is a variation of the standard Poodle breed.\n• Chocolate Poodles are recognized for their rich brown coat color.\n• They are known for their intelligence and trainability.\n• Poodles, including the Chocolate variety, are hypoallergenic.\n• Chocolate Poodles can come in three sizes: standard, miniature, and toy.\n• They require regular grooming to maintain their coat.\n• Chocolate Poodles are often used in various dog sports and activities.",
